# E-fitness — e-fitness.ds

> A high-energy, modern aesthetic blending Swiss-style clean typography with a dark, immersive background and vibrant neon accents to inspire action.

## Instructions
- Use `{color.palette.bg}` (#0A0A0A) for all main section backgrounds.
- Apply `{color.palette.accent}` (#C0FF00) sparingly for CTAs, metrics, and active states.
- Headlines must use Sora (`{typography.family.primary}`) with heavy weights (700-800).
- Body text should be DM Sans (`{typography.family.body}`) for maximum readability on dark backgrounds.
- All containers should use large corner radii (`{radius.xl}` / 40px) and frosted glass effects (`{elevation.surface}`).

## Brand & Accent
- **Neon Chartreuse** (`{color.palette.accent}`): The pulse of the brand. Used for primary CTAs (`cta-primary`), live status indicators, and highlighting AI-generated data.

## Surface
- **Ink Black** (`{color.palette.bg}`): The foundation.
- **Slate Surface** (`{color.palette.surface}`): Used for secondary lift, bento cells, and chat panels. Always paired with a subtle border (`{color.palette.glass-border}`).

## Text
- **Pure White** (`{color.palette.white}`): High contrast for primary headings.
- **Zinc Muted** (`{color.palette.zinc-400}` / `{color.palette.zinc-500}`): Used for body copy and metadata to reduce visual fatigue.

## Fonts
- **Sora**: Confident, geometric, and modern. Used for all branding and display text.
- **DM Sans**: Clean and functional. Used for interface elements, chat bubbles, and long-form content.

## Layout
- **Bento Grid**: Asymmetric layouts that mix content and data widgets.
- **Sticky Panels**: Used for feature deep-dives to keep context during scroll.

## Imagery & Asset Usage
- **Bento Hero**: 3D or high-quality product renders that sit within the grid. Should feel integrated with the dark UI.
- **Generation Prompt**: "A floating 3D fitness metric dashboard, neon chartreuse accents (#C0FF00) on dark slate glass panels (#1A1D24), soft glow, isometric view, transparent background, premium technical feel — 16:9".

### Background Assets
- **Neon Blobs**: Large, blurred ambient glows (`{color.palette.neon-muted}`) placed behind sections to provide depth without distracting from the UI.
- **Generation Prompt**: "Seamless ambient neon chartreuse glow, heavy gaussian blur, 5% opacity, dark canvas background, smooth color transition — 16:9, loopable".

## Icons & Motifs
- **Tabler Icons**: Use stroke-based icons with 1.5px or 2px weights.
- **Motif**: Pulsing live dots and progress bars using the accent color.

## Animation & Motion
- **Signature Stagger**: Bento cells should slide in laterally using GSAP.
- **Smooth Scroll**: Mandatory Lenis integration for a premium feel.
- **Scroll Reveals**: Section content should fade up into position as it enters the viewport.

## Components
- `cta-primary` — The high-visibility neon button.
- `glass-card` — The standard content container with blur and border.
- `nav-pill` — Rounded navigation links with active accent states.

## Do
- Maintain high contrast between text and background.
- Use the neon accent to guide the user's eye to primary actions.
- Use frosted glass blurs for all overlay elements.

## Don't
- Don't use the neon accent for body text or large background areas.
- Don't use sharp corners (radius < 8px).
- Don't clutter the bento grid with too many small widgets.

## Signature
- The asymmetric bento grid hero with an integrated video loop is the system's primary visual hook.

## Notes
- Dark theme only; no light mode implementation observed.
- Icons are stroke-based; avoid solid fills except for brand markers.